  "body": "Some steps in \"prepare a script\" are nice and precise about documents. They establish a parser-time document, a preparation time document (= the node document at that time); they make sure they are the same.\r\n\r\nThen things get imprecise around step 26-28, with one instance of \"the pending parsing-blocking script of the Document\" and lots of talk about \"the Document of the parser that created the element\". These could be cleaned up.",
